Your task is to write a function that takes a Laravel language file as input and extracts all the translatable strings present in the file. The translatable strings should be returned as a list of unique identifiers.

For example, given the following code snippet:
```
<p>
    {!! __(
    'emails/projects/members.created.message',
    ['name' => $user->name, 'project' => $project->name]
    )
    !!}
