### Solution:
```php
function parseRoutes($routeDefinitions) {
    $parsedRoutes = [];
    foreach ($routeDefinitions as $definition) {
        list($method, $route) = explode(' ', $definition);
        list($controller, $controllerMethod) = explode('@', $route);
