You are tasked with implementing a Swift function that processes an array of `CityTourInfoOptionData` instances and returns a new array containing only the unique city names. Each `CityTourInfoOptionData` instance has a `name` property representing the city name. Your task is to filter out duplicate city names and return a new array containing only the unique city names in the order they first appeared in the input array.

