The function should take an array of `CityTourInfoOptionData` instances as input and return an array of unique city names in the order they first appeared in the input array.

For example, given the input array:
```swift
let cities = [
    CityTourInfoOptionData(name: "Paris"),
    CityTourInfoOptionData(name: "London"),
    CityTourInfoOptionData(name: "Paris"),
    CityTourInfoOptionData(name: "Rome"),
    CityTourInfoOptionData(name: "London")
]
```
