For example, given the input:
```php
$items = [
    ['id' => 1, 'name' => 'Screw'],
    ['id' => 2, 'name' => 'Bolt'],
    ['id' => 1, 'name' => 'Screw'],
    ['id' => 3, 'name' => 'Nut'],
    ['id' => 2, 'name' => 'Bolt'],
];
```
The function should return:
```php
[
    ['id' => 1, 'name' => 'Screw'],
    ['id' => 2, 'name' => 'Bolt'],
    ['id' => 3, 'name' => 'Nut'],
]
```
