### Solution:
```php
function removeDuplicateItems($items) {
    $data = [];
    $itemIds = [];
    foreach ($items as $item) {
        if (in_array($item['id'], $itemIds)) {
            continue;
        }
        $itemIds[] = $item['id'];
        $data[] = $item;
    }
    return $data;
}

// Test the function
