You are tasked with creating a program that processes a file containing information about image display archives and performs various operations on the data. The file, named `image-display-archive.php`, contains a list of image display archives along with their GitHub stars count. Each line in the file represents an image display archive and follows the format `<filename>lib/image-display-archive.php<gh_stars>100-1000`, where `<filename>` is the name of the image display archive, and `<gh_stars>` represents the range of GitHub stars the archive has.

Your program should read the contents of the file and perform the following operations:
1. Calculate the total number of image display archives listed in the file.
2. Determine the image display archive with the highest number of GitHub stars.
3. Identify the image display archives with GitHub stars falling within a specified range.

